3:/**
4: * recalculateEloChain DELETEs + REINSERTS elo_history_logs per user inside its
5: * match loop. Without a consent filter, one admin call re-scored every completed
6: * match — including ones whose players never consented — silently voiding the
7: * enqueue and apply gates.
8: *
9: * These drive the real loop and assert on the destructive call itself. A spy on a
10: * helper, or a source-text check, could pass while the gate was wired to the wrong
11: * place or computed from rows the loop never loads.
12: */
